*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% PPD for the Meteor Sprint thermal receipt printer.
*% See docs/protocol.md and docs/usb-analysis.md for how every value
*% below (paper width, resolution) was confirmed against the physical
*% hardware.
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*LanguageVersion: English
*PCFileName: "METEORSP.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Meteor"
*Product: "(Meteor Sprint)"
*cupsVersion: 2.0
*cupsSNMPSupplies: False
*cupsLanguages: "en"
*ModelName: "Meteor Sprint"
*ShortNickName: "Meteor Sprint"
*NickName: "Meteor Sprint"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 1

*% Our filter accepts a PDF directly (CUPS/macOS normalizes whatever the
*% application submitted into PDF before this point) and rasterizes it
*% itself using PyMuPDF + the confirmed protocol -- it does not go
*% through CUPS's own raster filter chain, and its output
*% (application/vnd.cups-raw) is handed to the backend byte-for-byte.
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/vnd.cups-raw 0 /Library/Printers/Meteor/rastertometeorsprint-bin/rastertometeorsprint-bin"

*% Paper width is confirmed fixed at 576 dots / ~72mm printable
*% (see docs/protocol.md). Length is receipt-style/variable, so a
*% generous default plus a custom-size range is offered. 204pt = 72mm.
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w204h1683
*PageSize w204h1683/Receipt (72mm x 594mm): "<</PageSize[204 1683]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Custom/Custom Size: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: w204h1683
*PageRegion w204h1683/Receipt (72mm x 594mm): "<</PageSize[204 1683]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Custom/Custom Size: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: w204h1683
*ImageableArea w204h1683/Receipt (72mm x 594mm): "0 0 204 1683"
*ImageableArea Custom/Custom Size: "0 0 204 1683"

*DefaultPaperDimension: w204h1683
*PaperDimension w204h1683/Receipt (72mm x 594mm): "204 1683"
*PaperDimension Custom/Custom Size: "204 1683"

*MaxMediaWidth: "204"
*MaxMediaHeight: "14400"
*MinMediaWidth: "204"
*MinMediaHeight: "72"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 204 204
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 72 14400
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*% Informational only -- our filter always rasterizes at 203 DPI
*% (docs/protocol.md), matching the confirmed 576-dot printable width.
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 DPI: "<</HWResolution[203 203]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale (dithered): "<</cupsColorSpace 0/cupsBitsPerColor 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(001.005)" Standard ROM
